finish({'A(i)':5,'A(ii)':15,'B':30,'C':30},[14,15,16,17,18,19],'No finite printed choose-k pool occurs. Benefits of intrapreneurship and technology impacts are open examples. The three management skills belong to one supported evaluation; the scheme’s overall or per-skill evaluation allowances do not create printed alternative tasks.', ['Part A splits at 5/15. The second part retains its unequal 8/7 benefit allocations.','B explicitly requires a different case link for each impact.','C retains either six overall evaluation marks or 2+2+2, without double counting.','Scheme PDF pages are one greater than printed numbers.'])
